## plan
- set up the fastify server and configure it to handle json requests.
- connect to an sqlite3 database and create tables for storing user and secret data.
- implement the `/register` endpoint to handle user registration, storing user details in the database.
- implement the `/login` endpoint to authenticate users by verifying their credentials against the database.
